WEBVTT

00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:19.498
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Who’s next?

00:00:26.371 --> 00:00:29.468
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Can I have a cheese sandwich, please?

00:00:35.846 --> 00:00:36.682
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Anything else?

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:45.502
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> And a Coke, please.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.681
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Ice and lemon?

00:00:58.801 --> 00:00:59.408
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> No, thanks.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.081
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> There you go.

00:01:26.025 --> 00:01:28.304
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Thanks. How much is it?

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:35.933
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Six pounds seventy-five.

00:01:42.369 --> 00:01:42.901
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Here you are.

00:01:48.927 --> 00:01:49.663
<v><b>Barman:</b></v> Thanks.

00:01:58.116 --> 00:01:59.166
Here’s your change.